      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Biianwa bia naikara eye kumwiiko kumuyia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khu ndaalo enyoa eye kumwesi kukhola saba mube ne libuusiana litakatifu khulwe khukhwisaaya. Mukhakholakho kumulimo kwosi kwosi tawe. Endaalo yino eliba eye khukhupa chikhoombi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhaane siianwa sie khukhwosia nga esilikakha esiimisia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Aana euunwa ndala endiiti, limiiku lilala, ne kamameeme ke siseecha saba ke bukhulu bwe kumwiiko mulala, kakhalikhoomo butekhele tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi aana siianwa sie biakhulia sie bufu butubaasie ne kamafura: bitaru khwikhumi bie siikula sie bufu khulwe buli euunwa, bibili khwikhumi khu buli limiiku, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne silala khwikhumi khu buli limeeme khu mameeme saba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi aana endurume ndala khulwe siianwa sie khurusiao bubwoni bwenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aana bino khutasakho khu siianwa sie khukhwosia khulwe endaalo enyoa eye kumwesi, alala ne siianwa siayo sie biakhulia, ne siianwa sie khukhwosia sia buli lwosi alala ne siianwa siayo sie biakhulia ne siianwa sie khunywa. Biaane khuloondekhana ne lilaka liabio khulwe khubiosia nga esilikakha esiimisia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Biianwa bie ndaalo eye khurusiao bubwoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
