                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Khu ndaalo ekhola ekhumi eye kumwesi kwa saba, mube ne libuusiana litakatifu. Khu ndaalo eyo mukhalia namwe mukhakholakho kumulimo tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aana khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi siianwa sie khukhwosia, nga esilikakha emusiimisia. Mukhaane euunwa endiiti, limiiku lilala, ne kamameeme ke siseecha saba ke bukhulu bwe kumwiiko mulala, koosi kakhalikhoomo butekhele tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muaane siianwa sie biakhulia sie bufu butubaanisibwe ne kamafura: bitaru khwikhumi bie siikula sie bufu khu buli euunwa, bibili khwikhumi khu limiiku, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne silala khu buli limeeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi aana endurume ndala khulwe siianwa sie bubwoni, khutasa khu siianwa sie khurusiao bubwoni, ne siianwa sie khukhwosia sia buli lwosi alala ne siianwa sie biakhulia ne siianwa sie khunywa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
