            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.13+DEU.16.14+DEU.16.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Likh. 16.13-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Khu ndaalo eye ekhumi na chiraano eye kumwesi kwa saba, mube ne libuusiana litakatifu. Mukhakholakho kumulimo tawe. Mulaba ne naikara khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi khulwe chindaalo saba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhaane siianwa sie khukhwosia, nga esilikakha esiimisia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Aana chiuunwa chindiiti ekhumi na chitaru, kamamiiku kabili, ne kamameeme ke siseecha ke bukhulu bwe kumwiiko mulala likhumi na kane, koosi kakhalikhoomo butekhele tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aana siianwa sie biakhulia sie bufu butubaanisibwe ne kamafura. Aana bitaru khwikhumi bie siikula silala sie bufu khu uunwa ekhumi na chitaru ne bibili khwikhumi bie bufu khu buli limiiku khu mamiiku kabili, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "silala khwi khumi sie bufu khu buli limeeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi aana endurume ndala khulwa siianwa sie khurusiao bubwoni khutasa khu siianwa sie khukhwosia sia buli lwosi alala ne siianwa siasio sie biakhulia ne siianwa sie khunywa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
