          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Khu ndaalo ekhola khabili eya naikara aana chiuunwa chindiiti likhumi na chibili, kamamiiku kabili, kamameeme ke siseecha ekhumi na kane ke kumwiiko mulala buli lilala bikhalikhoomo butekhele tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biaane alala ne siianwa sie biakhulia ne siianwa sie khunywa khulwe chiuunwa, kamamiiku, ne kamameeme, khuloondekhana ne lilaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aana lundi endurume ndala khulwe siianwa sie khurusiao bubwoni khutasa khu siianwa sie khukhwosia sia buli lwosi ne siianwa siasio sie biakhulia ne biianwa biayo bie khunywa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
