              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Khu ndaalo ekhola khataru eya naikara aana chiuunwa chindiiti likhumi na ndala, kamamiiku kabili, ne kamameeme ke siseecha ke bukhulu bwe kumwiiko mulala likhumi na kane, bioosi bikhalikhoomo butekhele tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
