            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Khu ndaalo ekhola khane aana chiuunwa likhumi chindiiti, kamamiiku kabili ne kamameeme ke siseecha likhumi na kane ke bukhulu bwe kumwiiko mulala, bioosi bikhalikhoomo butekhele tawe. ",
